          <details>
            <summary><h3>Which Peloton membership do I need for a regular treadmill?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              App+ if treadmill classes are the main use; it was $28.99 a month or $289 a year on Peloton's site on 21 November 2026. App One was $12.99 a month but limited to three cardio equipment classes a month. Check Peloton's current prices before signing up.
            </p>
